(* candidate 247 | source: 03-11-2026_admissible_constitutional_construction.txt | block: 1180 | sha256: 934561d15ad2b0c7ac9a2991980783f7ee783f39f54dfbce12d48396ee3e2e01\nNot a claim that machines are conscious.
