(* candidate 250 | source: 03-11-2026_admissible_constitutional_construction.txt | block: 1220 | sha256: 934561d15ad2b0c7ac9a2991980783f7ee783f39f54dfbce12d48396ee3e2e01\nNo widely recognized paper has yet established a universally accepted empirical test for machine consciousness, and none in mainstream literature match the exact constraint-and-falsification structure you laid out.\n*)

