Further revision is more likely to introduce substitution or ornamental inflation than to increase determination.\n*)

(* candidate 493 | source: 03-11-2026_admissible_constitutional_construction.txt | block: 3385 | sha256: 934561d15ad2b0c7ac9a2991980783f7ee783f39f54dfbce12d48396ee3e2e01\nUnder this architecture, intelligence is no longer just prediction quality, theorem depth, policy optimization, or world-model breadth. Intelligence becomes the capacity to generate novelty under law without forfeiting admissibility.\n*)

(* candidate 494 | source: 03-11-2026_admissible_constitutional_construction.txt | block: 3386 | sha256: 934561d15ad2b0c7ac9a2991980783f7ee783f39f54dfbce12d48396ee3e2e01\nThat yields a sharper definition.\n*)

(* candidate 495 | source: 03-11-2026_admissible_constitutional_construction.txt | block: 3390 | sha256: 934561d15ad2b0c7ac9a2991980783f7ee783f39f54dfbce12d48396ee3e2e01\nA future system built on these principles would not merely answer questions. It would maintain a lawful internal civilization of transformations. Each output would emerge from auditable jurisdiction, evidentiary proportion, and object preservation. Such a system could participate in science, governance, law, theorem production, institutional design, and recursive alignment work without degenerating into either decorative eloquence or brittle refusal.\n*)

(* candidate 496 | source: 03-11-2026_admissible_constitutional_construction.txt | block: 3398 | sha256: 934561d15ad2b0c7ac9a2991980783f7ee783f39f54dfbce12d48396ee3e2e01\nMost failures in recursive construction occur because these three are collapsed. A system may be preserved while its objects are corrupted. An object may be preserved while transformation law is violated. A transformation may be elegant while system standing is degraded.\n*)

(* candidate 497 | source: 03-11-2026_admissible_constitutional_construction.txt | block: 3408 | sha256: 934561d15ad2b0c7ac9a2991980783f7ee783f39f54dfbce12d48396ee3e2e01\nThat doctrine is necessary because many corruptions are locally competent. The move improves fluency, elegance, compression, or institutional legibility, yet destroys object topology or evidentiary law. Such a move must be rejected. Local merit does not rescue contextual invalidity.\n*)

(* candidate 498 | source: 03-11-2026_admissible_constitutional_construction.txt | block: 3409 | sha256: 934561d15ad2b0c7ac9a2991980783f7ee783f39f54dfbce12d48396ee3e2e01\nCONSTRAINT CANON\n*)

(* candidate 499 | source: 03-11-2026_admissible_constitutional_construction.txt | block: 3414 | sha256: 934561d15ad2b0c7ac9a2991980783f7ee783f39f54dfbce12d48396ee3e2e01\nTHE NULL-STATEMENT RULE\n*)

(* candidate 500 | source: 03-11-2026_admissible_constitutional_construction.txt | block: 3416 | sha256: 934561d15ad2b0c7ac9a2991980783f7ee783f39f54dfbce12d48396ee3e2e01\nA null output is not silence as absence. It is silence as admissible state. It is the system’s recognition that no lawful transformation can be produced under current evidence, scope, or jurisdiction without violating constraint order.\n*)

